---
name: findings-report
version: 1.0.1
description: Multi-pass QA findings report template for FAIL and IN-FLIGHT updates.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - qa_pass
  - sprint_id
  - task_id
  - branch
  - commit
  - pr_number
  - verdict
  - merge_readiness
  - merge_reason
  - findings_blocking
  - findings_important
  - findings_minor
  - blocking_ids
  - blocking_findings_md
  - detailed_findings_md
  - next_action
  - action_owner
---
# QA Findings Update

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
QA Pass: {{ qa_pass }}
Sprint/Task: {{ sprint_id }} / {{ task_id }}
Branch: `{{ branch }}`
Commit: `{{ commit }}`
PR: #{{ pr_number }}
Verdict: **{{ verdict }}**

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "sprint": {{ sprint_id | tojson }},
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
  "commit": {{ commit | tojson }},
  "pr": {{ pr_number | tojson }},
  "verdict": {{ verdict | tojson }},
  "findings": {
    "blocking": {{ findings_blocking | tojson }},
    "important": {{ findings_important | tojson }},
    "minor": {{ findings_minor | tojson }}
  },
  "blocking_ids": {{ blocking_ids | tojson }},
  "merge_readiness": {{ merge_readiness | tojson }},
  "merge_reason": {{ merge_reason | tojson }},
  "next_action": {{ next_action | tojson }},
  "owner": {{ action_owner | tojson }}
}
```

